new_head "legends"
new_text "It has occured to me that every guild get's powers at legend lvlsexcept us. Wheather it be spells or more hp they get something.I think we should get something so I have a few ideas. First off howabout a throw for smoke or flash bombs? I also thinkBackstab multipliers aren't to far fetched. On a wim how abouta garret command similar to the druids slay living?Anything that doesn't make it's savings roll get's it's windpipe crushed in oneshot. We probably will get these suggestions ignored like everything else.So post suggestions and lets see if someone will listen. Sorry about the mess.shouting is still the in thing I guess-The frustrated Shades"
