 thieves. I'dalso like to ask all the newbies if you don't have anything to say don'ttie up the guild line it's a pain in the ass to us who use it for useful things. Any questions newbies can ask me just don't constantlybother we with trivial things.-Shades**ive had food poisoning for the past week...its over now and im back to fuck thismud up again               *big grin*                   Mauvais**     Barbara vs. Rtu        Another one bites the dust.                    Mauvais, the master swine**WOWOW!I like this mentor stuff... :)Your Thormy... (|-}**I came back to visit school and work but my boss isn't here so i am taking a break to visit here...I think the mentor thing is an excellent idea...ask Svengali I helped him out...I would like to be a mentor if we have them...Spring break sux...this is only the third day and I am already bored...Umass riverhawks hockey team made finals by winning last Friday night and they will be playing in the Boston garden... of course I will be attending the game both friday and saturday...As for Majik I think I am the best flirt in the guild...You flirt with anything and everything that talks...I am a good flirt but we can put this to a vote someday that we are both on....Vote for me 'cause you all know I love to flirt with ya'all...We'll seeWell Happy dayLovingly Yours  Oscar =)**well well, hi-de-ho folkslove ya all :)your dear uncle mango**Spring break and I am still at this school...Just thought I drop a line and say hello to you all.Hugs and Kisses to all that I usually give them to...Oscar**I'm very happy to inform you Griffy that as a wiz you will get a nice toolcalled bboots so you can check this board more regulary.... :):-} Thormy...**goody then she can read more of my fun and informing notes!!!!!!!!!!hahahahaha**Well it's nice to see that the enire purpose of a backstab has beendefeated. Now we have to take an attack just to use it? I thought thewhole purpose of it was to give us an advantage. Well that has goneout the window. I guess the next step is to remove the hide command also.I also find it amazing that the damage of our backstab has been loweredonce again. Soon I guess maybe we'll be reduced to killing rabbits if we'relucky. I just hope there can be something done about this bs before webecome even a bigger joke than the jedis.Shades**	Hop on over to Batmud then..  Supposed to have a cool thievesguild there (not in it myself yet tho, got too high before I foundout where it was...).  Address is:  bat.cs.hut.fi   (no port #)			/// Dorien, Prince of Thieves \\\\\\**	OK, this really fucking sucks..  I just went to backstabFRODO, and it didn't kill him in 1 shot.  >>FRODO<<< !!!  Thisis really silly now, we can't even kill shit in adamn NEWBIE AREA in one shot any more???   Where's ourGM?  Why isn't he defending us?????			/// Dorien, Prince of Thieves \\\\\\**Heya folks,I would just like to add to the complaints in our guild.  Backstab both weakened and we get hit on it?? What the fuck! If I get stabbed in the back, I wouldn't hit the same round.  Ambush, somewhat useful after a failed backstab.  Snares and ability to steal??? Hmmm...I thought thieves did just those things.  Shades is right, Hide will be next.  Maybe we should just be tied to a stake in a room with Shao Kahn when we come on from now on.  For those thieves with Pk Licences, thats all you are, Roaming meat for other guilds.  If the arches want to erase the thief guild I wish they'd say so cause this is ridiculous!!!  This guild used to be fun,  I don't blame Kryll for this but a stand has to be taken cause this is just plain wrong...	Disgruntled Thief Windcane...er..Windbane		B-(**You are all absolutely right...I still can't do anything about it but to mailand mail and mail and mail and mail ... .. .YoursThorm(y)**Well, try Wonderland... Loke needs playtesters for the thieves guild... Just logon when it reopens and mail him...Tris.**Could you tell us the IP to wunderland ?Thanx.Blade the Bored.**	Wonderland: 152.94.1.43 3287	Batmud: bat.cs.hut.fi	Find outselves a new thieves guild on other muds...          ourselves even..			/// Dorien, Player of Batmud \\\\\\**From what I gather, and please don't hold me to this, a few (if even that)self-appointed high-ass level wizards have decided to balance out all theguilds so everyone is even on all shit.  Guess they figure that backstab istoo powerful of a power to have for a guild so they went into the code andaltered it down.  This is the new order setting in.Same self-appointed group figured barbarians had too many hit points sowent into Gambit's code and altered that - without notification!!!Guess either suffer the affects or go elsewhere is all I can say.>>>>>Axlrose - ...<<<<<**ok all......after reading all the shit........I think we should find a new mud together and continue rto thieve gtogether.Yes...yes...soon, sometime(need to age 3 days) I will wizhopefully I will be able to get in as a thief wiz and fix some shit-=Thief-Legend Griffon the Elven Princess of the Thieves Guild=-**Ok...now I'm pissed.This backstab shit is a fucking joke. Scuse the language for the ladies readin this, but it had to be said.I'll see what I can do about it since I personally know 3 arch wizzes. We'll get this little, well ok...really huge stinking mound of bullshit taken care of asap. i seen a lot of shit piled up before workin/livin on farms, but this definately takes the cake.Irritated thief Taz who is about to load all this on a shit spreader and spread some of it around to other guilds.**Dont want to burst yer bubble or anything, butI wouldnt hold your breath waiting for the guildto get better and/or think you can improve it.Ive tried, and right now, the thieves guild are noteven a shadow of their former glory.  Hehe, andto think that we all thought that the thieves guildwas weak then!Once I get through midterms, I think Im going to take a walk on over to batmud...  Cya all around.The Bored Blade**	I'm told that the thieves on Batmud are fun, and that they have alotof cool skills...  I go under Dorien there also because someone has alreadytaken my name of choice...:(  I play a Minotaur fighter there, so gimmea tell and I'll try to help ya out..:)  Its an absolutly HUGEgame, you can pick from over 30 races - each with special powers, anexcellent skill/spell system, optional quests called 'level quests' thatcut xp needed for that level in 1/2 - otherwise OPTIONAL, everyone I'vemet has been really friendly, and the wizzies DO NOT interfere/play/change/or fuck with things/you.  Tis the last great true RPG mud whereparties are usefull and almost necessary - fighters need healers,healers and mages need fighters, etc etc.  	Oh well, not that I've given my Batmud speach, I think I'll go backand play some more...:)  Its a little intimidating at first cuz of thesize and volume of things to play with, but stick with it..  Gimme a telland I'll get ya started..:)   hehe   			SEE YA THERE!!			   /// Dorien, Prince of Thieves \\\\\\P.S.address: bat.cs.hut.fi(no port #, the mud is so  huge it IS the site!)**ok ok ok ok ok what the fuck is up with backstabcheck this out heres what happens:backstab monkMonk hit youMonk hit youMonk hit youMonk hit youYour find a vulnerable spot and backstab monkmonk diedwhat the fuck is that???whole idea of a BACKSTAB is to be a surprise attackif i get hit 4 times by a WEAK monster before the stab goes throughthen what the fuck is the sense of having backstab then???might as well not have it rather than that bullshitoh and i noticed that it became weak as shit tooalong with ambushjust letting you all know that this sucks ballsand whoever changed it has a fart in his headid like to know whatd going on....thanxBeelzebubThe Prince Of Darkness**I looked at the 